6c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d57805f2d1f45c2474f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37066-1-12-2","ko":"저런. 어머니 생각이 많이 나시나 보네요.","zh":"哎呀，看来您非常想念母亲呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런.","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이","meaning":"着想，考虑","explanation":"생각：着想，考虑；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"7","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이","audio":"/audio/4cbc2bb73481851c34fc.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"나시나","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나시나","audio":"/audio/655e0eb16394d70fd729.mp3"}},{"text":"보네요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보네요","audio":"/audio/a6513b811204efa2ffc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"着想，考虑","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"关心某人或某事并对其倾注心意；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"想起，想到","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"想法或记忆等浮现。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f7867cec99adb9afd9b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.885,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37066","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":98,"sequenceScore":2.6103,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["昨晚因为思念已故的母亲，我根本睡不着觉。","哎呀，看来您非常想念母亲呢。","我们不太饿，要不别吃米饭，吃点零食吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨晚因为思念已故的母亲，我根本睡不着觉。","哎呀，看来您非常想念母亲呢。","我们不太饿，要不别吃米饭，吃点零食吧？"],"answer":1}]}
